<title>ITALY: SOCCER-FIORENTINA BEAT MILAN IN ITALIAN SUPERCUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIORENTINA BEAT MILAN IN ITALIAN SUPERCUP.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Cup winners Fiorentina beat</p>
<p>league champions Milan 2-1 (halftime 1-1) in the pre-season</p>
<p>Supercoppa (SuperCup) in Milan on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Fiorentina - Gabriel Batistuta (11th, 83rd)</p>
<p>Milan - Dejan Savicevic (21st)</p>
<p>Attendance: 29,582</p>
</text>
